count":11},"text":"马上过年了，我家是开卤肉店的，我给大家准备了2个卤猪蹄作为新年礼物，全部都是真空塑封打包好的，在评论区里抽，也让大家尝尝我们山西人的手艺😁 https://t.co/ILXwIpUj3l","url":"https://x.com/Guillermin45548/status/2020499989303308396"},{"author_id":"1880947070837964800","created_at":"2026-02-08T10:38:36.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2020447162153189885"],"id":"2020447162153189885","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":32090,"like_count":49,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":38,"retweet_count":0},"text":"运营了半个月，抖音关注量都没破百，唯一火的一个视频还是露脚丫子的，记录送外卖的vlog真的那么无聊？","url":"https://x.com/Guillermin45548/status/2020447162153189885"},{"author_id":"1880947070837964800","created_at":"2026-02-08T08:04:49.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2020408461876687190"],"id":"2020408461876687190","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":3,"impression_count":59596,"like_count":38,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":5,"retweet_count":0},"text":"我说过了，没事别惹外卖员 https://t.co/CjtTD8heUN","url":"https://x.com/Guillermin45548/status/2020408461876687190"},{"author_id":"1880947070837964800","created_at":"2026-02-08T02:08:12.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2020318715292831884"],"id":"2020318715292831884","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":31090,"like_count":21,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":47,"retweet_count":0},"text":"谁跟我一样没办法接受吃动物头啊？ https://t.co/LDOciTncZS","url":"https://x.com/Guillermin45548/status/2020318715292831884"},{"author_id":"1880947070837964800","created_at":"2026-02-07T13:48:38.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2020132600849871307"],"id":"2020132600849871307","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":13524,"like_count":14,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":13,"retweet_count":0},"text":"今天没上班回了一趟家给我爸过生日，明天又要开始奋斗了，今晚尽量早点睡，你们有啥能快速进入梦乡的方法吗？","url":"https://x.com/Guillermin45548/status/2020132600849871307"},{"author_id":"1880947070837964800","created_at":"2026-02-07T10:44:43.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2020086313186390415"],"id":"2020086313186390415","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":13,"impression_count":149544,"